Package: remotecompanion
Version: 3.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Maintainer: saihgupr <saihgupr@github.com>
Installed-Size: 2048
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 14.0)
Section: Tweaks
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/saihgupr/remotecompanion
Description: Fast, scriptable system control for modern jailbreaks
 RemoteCompanion brings fast, scriptable system control to modern rootless and rootful jailbreaks. It lets you bind physical gestures and hardware buttons, or send commands remotely from your computer.
 .
 Features:
  - Hardware Triggers: Bind actions to Power/Volume buttons, Home button, Touch ID
  - Web UI & Automations API: Desktop-class automation hub at http://[DEVICE_IP]:8080
  - Scheduled Triggers: Execute action sequences at specific times and days
  - Cross-Version Support: Full compatibility for iOS 14 through iOS 16+
  - Advanced Automation: NFC tags, custom Lua scripts, and native Siri integration
